   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>EEPROM Abstraction (Ea)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Provides uniform access to external and internal EEPROM devices.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00084\">Ea_Init</a> (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00190\">Ea_ConfigType</a>* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the EEPROM abstraction module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00085\">Ea_SetMode</a> ();</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function to switch the mode of the underlying EEPROM Driver</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00086\">Ea_Read</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Block Number, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Block Offset, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* DataBufferPtr, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Length);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Reads Length bytes of block Blocknumber at offset Block Offset into the buffer Data Buffer Ptr.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00087\">Ea_Write</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Block Number, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* DataBufferPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Writes the contents of the Data Buffer Ptr to the block Block Number.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00088\">Ea_Cancel</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Cancels the ongoing asynchronous operation.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">MemIf_StatusType <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00089\">Ea_GetStatus</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to return the Status.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">MemIf_JobResultType <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00090\">Ea_GetJobResult</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to return the Job Result.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00091\">Ea_InvalidateBlock</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Block Number);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Invalidates the block Block Number.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00092\">Ea_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* VersionInfoPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to get the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00093\">Ea_EraseImmediateBlock</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Block Number);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Erases the block Block Number.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00094\">Ea_JobEndNotification</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to report to this module the successful end of an asynchronous operation.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00095\">Ea_JobErrorNotification</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to report to this module the failure of an asynchronous operation.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00096\">Ea_MainFunction</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Service to handle the requested jobs and the internal management operations.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00099\">NvM_JobEndNotification</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function to be used by the underlying memory abstraction to signal end of job without error.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_Ea_00100\">NvM_JobErrorNotification</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function to be used by the underlying memory abstraction to signal end of job with error.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
